title: "LOWKEY: Enterprise-Grade Anti-Popularity Music Recommendation & Vector Retrieval Engine"
abstract: "A high-performance Approximate Nearest Neighbor (ANN) audio retrieval engine designed to eliminate algorithmic popularity bias in music discovery using multi-dimensional acoustic traits and semantic spaces."
